    "corrections": [
      "0377: entry gate labeled garden; fern gate remains closed before atlas lookup; willow/bamboo signs have posts; shared cushion placement adjusted.",
      "0378: reduced dragon relative to girl; removed duplicate bag before removal; aligned comb with fern roots and self-combing paw; fingertip touches paw on final page.",
      "0379: same fixed nine stars in sky and ink chart, partial cloud occlusion throughout; chart contrast increased; snail has three brown curved shell stripes; brush returned by final page.",
      "0380: 24 fixed patterned stone tiles; two head pieces share eye; red/yellow candidate retained; four legs and belly crescent; missing candidate/tail tiles shown separately without duplication; legs no longer crop below canvas.",
      "0381: fixed pencil garden landmarks, three shrubs, retained bridge/wall damage; blank route/shore entry removed in sequence; hand meets eraser in enlarged action; washed nose pink with gray ring away from distant water lines.",
      "0382: balls have tails and no limbs, two blue/gray samples compared, unused colors returned, weaving stays on loom until final page; finished mat lies flat under cup; gray sleeves and crescent clip retained.",
      "0383: twelve wood pieces without overlaps, whale painted within sea, old lid retained; three-piece vertical trial then eleven joined plus last loose tile; all twelve on flat wooden floor for final scene, separate rug."
    ],
    "limitations": "Simplified original geometric scenes; actual full contact-sheet and selected full-size visual checks recorded. Does not assert human full audio listening or publication."
  },
